 lish in the app.\nInstagram: hand-post the Reel from the kit.\nSnapchat: h
 and-post the Reel to Spotlight. 1) Download the 9:16 reel to your phone. 2
 ) Open Snapchat as @syzigyapp\, swipe up from the camera to open Memories\
 , then the Camera Roll tab\, and pick the video. 3) Tap Send To\, choose S
 potlight\, paste the caption and hashtags\, then Post. Or on a computer: m
 y.snapchat.com > Upload to Spotlight. Vertical video\, 60s or less. Captio
 n is in the kit.\nYouTube Shorts: hand-post the same 9:16 reel from the ki
 t. Title and description are in the kit's YouTube Shorts section when Ella
  has written a ### YouTube block\; otherwise copy is pending.\n\nKit: http
